  "body_text": "WE CAN LEARN ANGER CONTROL\n\nSome of us can get very angry about family, work, friendship, traffic, and community.\n\nAnger can affect all of our relationships, happiness, work, or school performance.\n\nAnger can be a learned behavior that can be traced back to the environment in which we have lived since childhood and the experiences we have gained.\n\nIn this case, we can change our minds and see events from a new perspective.\n\nWhen our thoughts change, our feelings change, our behavior changes. We can learn to control anger.\n\nWe can apply to a specialist for a calmer, happier and more successful future.",
